------------------------------------------------
MultiHeadAttention → this is the Transformer’s self-attention mechanism.

LayerNormalization + residual (skip) connections → exactly like in Transformers.

MLP block (Dense layers after attention) → standard in Transformer encoder blocks.

Stacked in a loop (transformer_layers=8) → so you have 8 Transformer encoder blocks stacked.

So yes — this is a Transformer model (ViT), not a CNN like ResNet or MobileNet. The only CNN part is the Conv2D patch extraction, which splits the input image into patch embeddings (like the original ViT paper).
